/// soft deletion for trash functionality via deleted_at.
///
/// Relationships with other models:
/// - Belongs to {@link multi_user_todo_members} via member_id - the owner
/// who created the todo
/// - Has many {@link multi_user_todo_histories} via todoId - edit history
/// records
/// - Has one {@link multi_user_todo_trashes} when soft deleted - trash bin
/// entry
///
/// Business constraints: Todos are scoped to their owner member. When
